codex
A key regime check now closes off the most obvious construction: when the witness uses exactly \(3k\) vertices, every valid packing must be a triangle factor, while the paper’s Corollary 1.6 forces minimum degree at least \(2k\). I’m measuring the natural planted distribution at that exact threshold; if ordinary triangle-greedy/restart finds factors reliably, it fails Track A, and if the same route is already short by hand there is no honest Track B compression gap.
