+`delta(G) >= 2k` (Theorem 1.1). Theorem 1.7 gives a planar regime with
+`|H_k(G)| - |L_k(G)| >= 2k`, and Theorem 1.8 gives the same bound for graphs
+with no two disjoint triangles.
